sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Source as Manual / Strategy / Algorithm / AI
    participant Service as PreTradeAuthorizationService
    participant Domain as Canonical Trading Domain
    participant Risk as RiskEngine
    participant Journal as PostgreSQL Trading Journal

    Source->>Service: Submit typed OrderIntentEnvelope
    Service->>Domain: Validate and freeze intent
    Domain-->>Service: Valid immutable intent
    Service->>Risk: Evaluate intent and current risk context
    Risk-->>Service: AUTHORIZED / REJECTED / HELD RiskAssessment
    Service->>Domain: Validate assessment and intent/environment binding
    Service->>Journal: Persist intent and assessment
    Note over Journal: One transaction: intent, risk assessment, audit, domain outbox
    Journal-->>Service: Commit receipt
    Service-->>Source: Persisted pre-trade decision

    Note over Service,Journal: No OMS order creation or broker dispatch in this coordinator
    Note over Source,Risk: RiskEngine remains the sole deterministic risk authority
